sequenceDiagram
  participant Auth as Successful authentication
  participant JWT as NextAuth JWT
  participant Registry as UserSession registry
  participant Request as Protected request
  Auth->>JWT: Set User id, role, status and opaque session id
  Auth->>Registry: Store hash of session id with expiry
  JWT-->>Request: HttpOnly session cookie
  Request->>Registry: Validate active session hash and account status
  Registry-->>Request: Active, expired or revoked
  Request-->>Request: Authorize or require sign-in
